<h2 class="h5 mt-4">Ringkasan per kursus</h2>
<?php if ( ! $course_rows): ?><div class="empty-card"><p class="mb-0">Belum ada aktivitas belajar yang sesuai periode dan filter ini.</p></div><?php else: ?>
<p><?php echo (int) $course_total; ?> kursus / kelompok aktivitas · halaman <?php echo (int) $course_page; ?> dari <?php echo (int) $course_page_count; ?></p>
<div class="table-responsive bg-white border rounded-4"><table class="table monitor-table mb-0"><caption class="visually-hidden">Ringkasan progres kursus pada halaman terpilih</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Kursus</th><th scope="col">Materi selesai / tercatat</th><th scope="col">Latihan dinilai / percobaan</th><th scope="col">Nilai terbaik</th><th scope="col">Kartu dikenal / tercatat</th><th scope="col">Game selesai / sesi</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<?php foreach ($course_rows as $row): ?><tr><th scope="row"><?php if (empty($family) && $row['course_id']): ?><a href="<?php echo html_escape(study_monitor_url('kelola/pembelajaran/pengguna/'.$user['id'], $filters, array('kursus' => $row['course_id'], 'tab' => 'materi', 'modul' => 'materi', 'konten' => ''))); ?>"><?php echo html_escape($row['course_title']); ?></a><?php else: ?><?php echo html_escape($row['course_title'] ?: 'Latihan keluarga privat'); ?><?php endif; ?></th><td><?php echo (int) $row['reading_done']; ?> / <?php echo (int) $row['reading_total']; ?></td><td><?php echo (int) $row['quiz_done']; ?> / <?php echo (int) $row['quiz_total']; ?></td><td><?php echo $row['best_score'] === NULL ? 'Belum dinilai' : html_escape($row['best_score']).'%'; ?></td><td><?php echo (int) $row['cards_known']; ?> / <?php echo (int) $row['cards_total']; ?></td><td><?php echo (int) $row['games_done']; ?> / <?php echo (int) $row['games_total']; ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?>
</tbody></table></div><p class="monitor-note mt-2">Penyebut materi/kartu adalah catatan dalam periode, bukan seluruh isi kurikulum. Nilai latihan berasal dari hasil yang sudah final. Cetakan mengikuti halaman kursus yang sedang dibuka.</p>
<?php if ($course_page_count > 1): ?><nav class="d-flex gap-3 no-print" aria-label="Halaman kursus dalam rapor"><?php if ($course_page > 1): ?><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="<?php echo html_escape(study_monitor_url($base, $filters, array('kursus_halaman' => $course_page - 1, 'tab' => $tab ?? ''))); ?>">Kursus sebelumnya</a><?php endif; ?><?php if ($course_page < $course_page_count): ?><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="<?php echo html_escape(study_monitor_url($base, $filters, array('kursus_halaman' => $course_page + 1, 'tab' => $tab ?? ''))); ?>">Kursus berikutnya</a><?php endif; ?></nav><?php endif; ?>
<?php endif; ?>
